  "solution": "Given equation: 36 + 27 - 75 × 5 ÷ 25 = 24.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷ and -\n\nGiven: 36 + 27 - 75 × 5 ÷ 25 = 24.\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 36 + __**27 ÷ 75**__ × 5 - 25 = 24\n\n⇒ 36 + __0.36____** × 5**__ - 25 = 24\n\n⇒ __**36 + 1.8**__ - 25 = 24\n\n⇒ __**37.8 - 25**__ = 24\n\n⇒ 12.8 ≠ 24\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) - and +**\n\nGiven: 36 + 27 - 75 × 5 ÷ 25 = 24\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 36 - 27 + 75 × __**5 ÷ 25**__ = 24\n\n⇒ 36 - 27 + __**75 × **__**__0.2__** = 24\n\n⇒ __**36**__ - 27 __**+ 15**__ = 24\n\n⇒ __**51 - 27**__ = 24\n\n⇒ **24 = 24**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) ÷ and ×\n\nGiven: 36 + 27 - 75 × 5 ÷ 25 = 24\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 36 + 27 - __**75 ÷ 5**__ × 25 = 24\n\n⇒ 36 + 27 - __15____** ×**____** 25**__ = 24\n\n⇒ __**36 + 27**__ - 375 = 24\n\n⇒ __63____ - 375__ = 24\n\n⇒ -312 ≠ 24\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) + and ÷\n\nGiven: 36 + 27 - 75 × 5 ÷ 25 = 24\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**36 ÷ 27**__ - 75 × 5 + 25 = 24\n\n⇒ 1.33 - __**75 × 5**__ + 25 = 24\n\n⇒ __**1.3**____**3**__ - 385 __**+ 25**__ = 24\n\n⇒ __26.33 - 385__ = 24\n\n⇒ -358.67 ≠ 24\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
